OL,3,GNEWSAReform politician says smart
OL,4,Aglasses help him make speeches in
OL,5,AWales' parliament
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Reform politician has said he is
OL,8,Fusing smart glasses with an in-built
OL,9,Fautocue feature to help him make
OL,10,Fspeeches in the Welsh Parliament.
OL,12,FJason O'Connell said the technology had
OL,13,Fhelped boost his confidence when
OL,14,Fspeaking in the Senedd, and denied it
OL,15,Frisked misleading people into thinking
OL,16,Fhe was speaking without notes.
OL,18,F"I'm delivering my words in the manner
OL,19,Fthat I see fit," he told the BBC's
OL,20,FPolitics Wales programme.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
