OL,3,GNEWSAReform politician says smart
OL,4,Aglasses help him make speeches in
OL,5,AWales' parliament
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut the Welsh Liberal Democrat leader
OL,8,Fcalled for the glasses to be banned
OL,9,Ffrom use in the Senedd, while a
OL,10,Fparliament spokesperson said a review
OL,11,Fwas under way.
